  "Gen_Library.scl a Gen_Main.scl: Program blocks → External source files →\n  Add new external file → pravý klik → Generate blocks from source (NEJDŘÍV knihovnu).": "Gen_Library.scl and Gen_Main.scl: Program blocks → External source files →\n  Add new external file → right-click → Generate blocks from source (library FIRST).",
  "Gen_Library.st / MAIN.st: editor POU má dvě části — do HORNÍ (deklarace) vlož řádky od FUNCTION_BLOCK / PROGRAM po poslední END_VAR, do DOLNÍ (implementace) zbytek BEZ END_FUNCTION_BLOCK / END_PROGRAM. Každý blok jako nový POU (Function Block, ST).": "Gen_Library.st / MAIN.st: the POU editor has two parts — paste the lines from FUNCTION_BLOCK / PROGRAM to the last END_VAR into the UPPER part (declaration) and the rest WITHOUT END_FUNCTION_BLOCK / END_PROGRAM into the LOWER part (implementation). Each block as a new POU (Function Block, ST).",
