  "LED prvek se objednává zvlášť: M22-LED-G (https://www.imc-direct.com/products/m22-led-g). V USA se prodává i sestava M22-L-G-G.": "The LED element is ordered separately: M22-LED-G (https://www.imc-direct.com/products/m22-led-g). In the USA the set M22-L-G-G is also sold.",
